~ greeting
Builder Otter: Hey.

=> END

~ awaiting_snack
Builder Otter: I ordered a {{DeliveryManager.current_snack.snack_name}}.

Builder Otter: Bring it before I starve to death over here.

=> END

~ wrong_snack
Builder Otter: That's not what I asked for.

Builder Otter: Get your [shake]$#?%[/shake] together.

=> END

~ snack_received
Builder Otter: Finally.

Builder Otter: Can't work on an empty stomach, you know.

=> END

~ not_configured
Builder Otter: That's not what I asked for.

Builder Otter: Get your [shake]$#?%[/shake] together.
=> END
